# With completed blocks hidden, completing two tasks in a row makes both disappear and leaves the focus on the next task.
file <<END
Today:
	- Call plumber
	- Buy stamps
	- Pay bills
END
keys gc j x x
see - Pay bills
hide Call plumber
hide Buy stamps
keys x
quit
saved <<END
Today:
	- Call plumber @done({today})
	- Buy stamps @done({today})
	- Pay bills @done({today})
END
